# Architecture diagrams

## Format

- Primary topology: **draw.io** under `docs/diagrams/` (not Mermaid).
- Icons: official AWS Architecture Icons via `mxgraph.aws4.*` — browse [jajera.github.io/aws-icons](https://jajera.github.io/aws-icons).
- Link the `.drawio` from `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` (and README if needed). Export SVG alongside when useful for Markdown previews.

## Title block

- Title: 26–28px bold Helvetica, left-aligned
- Subtitle: 13–14px Helvetica, `fontColor=#545B64`
- Orange separator under the subtitle: `strokeColor=#FF9900;strokeWidth=2`
- Title group width spans the diagram content

## Containers

- **Account / outer**: `fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=light-dark(#666666,#D4D4D4);rounded=1;shadow=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333`
  - Label: `profile · region · CIDR`
- **VPC**: `fillColor=light-dark(#8C4FFF0D,#8C4FFF0D);strokeColor=#8C4FFF;fillStyle=auto;rounded=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fontColor=#8C4FFF`
- **Service group** (120–140px wide, ~130px tall): category tint fill + matching stroke; label is the group title (12px bold)

| Category | fillColor | strokeColor / fontColor | Examples |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Compute | `#FFF2E8` | `#ED7100` | EC2, Lambda |
| Networking | `#EDE7F6` | `#8C4FFF` | VPC, VPN, NAT, Route 53 |
| App Integration | `#FCE4EC` | `#E7157B` | EventBridge |
| Security | `#FFEBEE` | `#DD344C` | IAM, RAM |

## Icons

- 48×48 inside the service group, typically at `(x≈46, y≈30)`
- Style: `shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.<service>;fillColor=<category>;strokeColor=#ffffff;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;shadow=1;sketch=0`
- Resource-only shapes (e.g. NAT) may use `shape=mxgraph.aws4.nat_gateway` instead of `resourceIcon`
- Label format: `Service name<div><i>role / note</i></div>`

## Edges

- `edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica`
- Labels: 11px; `labelBackgroundColor=light-dark(#FFFFFF,#232F3E)` with adaptive `fontColor=light-dark(light,dark)`
- Never use white-only label backgrounds

## Dark mode

Always use `light-dark()` for account strokes, VPC fills (`fillStyle=auto`), and edge label backgrounds/colors. Hex+alpha VPC fills (e.g. `#8C4FFF0D`) keep the tint readable in both themes.

## Font

`fontFamily=Helvetica` on every cell. Do not use Amazon Ember or system defaults.

## Local reference

Canonical example in this repo: `docs/diagrams/architecture.drawio`. Also see `.kiro/steering/architecture-diagrams.md`.
